r}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\land d\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\exists d:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\land d\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书推论4.1.13，印刷 p.221（DjVu 237）的存在性重述。商结构存在性来自超幂构造，映射用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b2fa45baaddb4aa3\" href=\"?note=b2fa45baaddb4aa3\" title=\"17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding\">17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding</a> 中的常值函数图；不是另一个原书4.3.3b结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"b2fa45baaddb4aa3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"bbcb80a62faf05ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrapower]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location